-- GAME ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Title       Pentagram
  Publisher   Ultimate Play The Game, 1986
  Version     1.0

-- YOU NEED ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Your own copy of the original game, saved beside this patch:

  File        Pentagram (1986)(Ultimate Play The Game).z80
  MD5         75b969b9da612b72c7780e11a862dbdd

  The patch carries none of the game's code. It only works with that exact
  dump, under that name or any other: anything else is refused, with a
  message naming the file it wants.

-- WHAT IT DOES --------------------------------------------------------------
  The game's play area has no colour clash, so none is removed: the default
  keeps the original look. The patch adds the menu, its cheats and the Next
  start-up. The menu's Next compatibility line adds more; see the note. Game
  logic is unchanged. Enhanced colours, an option on the menu, are below.

  Colours     Default (the game's own) plus: Enhanced, chosen on the menu, off
              by default.
  Enhanced    Owner-painted wizard, enemies, runes, objects, room scenery and
              HUD parts. Existing lines and original draw order retained; no
              exterior outline. Source: Enhanced colours by Jon Attree.

  Pace        slowdown removed

  Note        Original monochrome picture by default. Enhanced is optional and
              off by default. Both modes fit a 1MB Next. Known issues:
              individual update intervals retain some raster/publication
              jitter; tested scene averages are not slower. A complete natural
              game completion is not verified. Missing: physical Next testing.

-- MENU ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   1  Infinite lives
   2  Mega jump
   3  Start with 9 lives

  Archive POK behaviour verified against this exact 48K release. Immunity
  relabelled Infinite Lives because it prevents the life decrement only.
  Starting lives translated to the initialization immediate.

