-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      Full 18,000-frame original-input replay in both modes; exact
              registers/R, working RAM and original bitmap. Enhanced 26,448
              ordered plots and 1,970 full publication pictures; 512 hook ABI
              cases and 144 whole-effect cases. Matched native player-update
              timing, exact recolour roundtrip and boot tests. No physical
              hardware claim.

  Replay      18000 original input frames per mode. Default 6,476 and Enhanced
              10,279 completed outer hooks; exact registers including R, full
              48K except exact patch/checked return/dead stack. Dead-stack
              read-before-write audit passes. Original bitmap has no
              exception.

  Emulator    Native matched states, quiet/busy/cold measurements and
              original-clock beeper comparisons. Ordinary and NEXLOAD boot
              register/R/RAM checks pass.

  Coverage    Recorded menu, rooms, deaths, game over and restart. Initial-
              room capacity census and targeted boundary/cache/overflow
              fixtures; not a complete natural playthrough.

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
